  {
   "rating": 46,
   "date": "2020-01-25T06:26:50-06:00",
   "body": "Here are the [b]non-repeatable[/b] versions of the 5 quests from [npc=7505] and [npc=7506]:\n\n[ul]\n[li][quest=2603][/li]\n[li][quest=2601][/li]\n[li][quest=2583][/li]\n[li][quest=2585][/li]\n[li][quest=2581][/li]\n[/ul]\n\n[b]In order to complete them all, you will need the following:[/b]\n\n[ul]\n[li]14x [item=8396][/li]\n[li]11x [item=8394][/li]\n[li]6x  [item=8392][/li]\n[li]6x  [item=8393][/li]\n[li]5x  [item=8391][/li]\n[/ul]",
   "replies": []
  },
